      "id": "1945164856950206710",
      "title": "Key findings reveal a fascinating trade-off:\n\"Add\" agents (focus on new rules) \u2192 rapid point accumulation + high leadership turnover\n\"Modify\" agents (refine exi",
      "body": "Key findings reveal a fascinating trade-off:\n\"Add\" agents (focus on new rules) \u2192 rapid point accumulation + high leadership turnover\n\"Modify\" agents (refine existing rules) \u2192 greater stability + fewer but consistent leaders\nInnovation vs. stability\u2014a classic dilemma even for AI",
